<title>TURKEY: Turkish wholesale prices up 5.2 pct in May.</title>
<headline>Turkish wholesale prices up 5.2 pct in May.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's wholesale prices rose 5.2 percent in May compared with a 5.5 percent increase in April, the State Institute of Statistics said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It said May consumer prices rose 4.7 percent after a 6.6 percent rise the previous month.</p>
</text>
